1365
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:44,810
Okay!

1366
00:02:44,810 --> 00:02:47,520
My answer won't change, 
no matter how many times you ask.

1367
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:50,530
You don't have any friends, do you, Senpai?

1368
00:02:50,530 --> 00:02:52,400
I thought you'd be lonely during lunch.

1369
00:02:53,110 --> 00:02:55,030
I have friends, like, Haruto.

1370
00:02:55,030 --> 00:02:56,700
Let's eat.

1371
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:05,790
Well, my true objective is getting 
to know you better, you know.

1372
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:07,830
Don't bother.

1373
00:03:07,830 --> 00:03:11,960
You're the type of person that doesn't turn 
down their friends' requests, aren't you?

1374
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:14,590
I thought you'd even give me the okay for the photo.

1375
00:03:17,890 --> 00:03:20,680
Oh, right! Did you make any progress 
with the President?

1376
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,060
Nope, none at all.

1377
00:03:22,490 --> 00:03:25,440
That red book you had... 
That was her first choice, though.

1378
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:30,230
I was wondering why you'd have 
that when you got a recommendation.

1379
00:03:31,690 --> 00:03:35,070
Don't worry. I'll keep it a secret from her.

1380
00:03:35,070 --> 00:03:36,360
Oh, lemme have this one!

1381
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:42,990
Your mom's really good at cooking!

1382
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,410
Here, I'll give you this.

1383
00:03:53,470 --> 00:03:56,170
Your mom's cooking is tasty, too.

1384
00:03:56,170 --> 00:03:58,010
I made that, you know.

1385
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:04,470
Wanna have a cooked carrot, too?

1386
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:05,980
Here, open wide!

1387
00:04:08,050 --> 00:04:10,350
Eita, you got a minute?

1388
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:15,320
Wah! S-Sorry I interrupted!

1389
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:20,740
When the hell did Eita get to first base?!

1390
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:21,370
Whoa!

1391
00:04:21,370 --> 00:04:23,120
It's not like that!

1392
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,220
Hazuki?

1393
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,200
It was from my little sister.

1394
00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:51,060
Did this "something" have to do with Morikawa-san?

1395
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:55,170
I got a LINE message from her on Sunday, 
but I haven't replied to it yet.

1396
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:57,610
It's already Wednesday!

1397
00:04:57,610 --> 00:05:00,570
So... what do you think I should do?

1398
00:05:00,910 --> 00:05:04,450
All you can do is say sorry 
for ignoring her message for three days.

1399
00:05:04,450 --> 00:05:10,460
I can't do that! I don't have any idea what she wants 
to see me for, and I'm scared of making things clear!

1400
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:16,340
<i>I thought I'd kind of make things clear to Soma.</i>

1401
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:19,260
Making things clear, huh?

1402
00:05:19,930 --> 00:05:20,930
Eita?

1403
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:24,220
Haruto, you got a minute?

1404
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:25,720
Hm?

1405
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,350
Oh, Soma!

1406
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:33,980
<i>And</i> the much-talked-about
 <i>gakuran-clad</i> transfer student!

1407
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,570
Hazuki, look.

1408
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:48,120
We're gonna have a one at-bat game, okay?

1409
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,160
What for?

1410
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:55,080
Hit another home run, 
then you can respond to Morikawa-san.

1411
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,130
I don't get it!

1412
00:05:57,570 --> 00:05:58,960
He went this way, right?

1413
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,840
Forget it, Momoka!

1414
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:05,260
Oh, there he is!

1415
00:06:41,550 --> 00:06:42,970
Whenever you're ready.

1416
00:06:58,110 --> 00:06:59,440
That was close!

1417
00:07:03,570 --> 00:07:05,320
Dude...

1418
00:07:17,250 --> 00:07:20,250
You sure are bein' <i>real</i> cocky!

1419
00:07:25,050 --> 00:07:27,590
So, what about you?

1420
00:07:28,450 --> 00:07:29,880
What do you mean?

1421
00:07:30,230 --> 00:07:33,020
I'm talkin' about what you'll do if you win.

1422
00:07:34,230 --> 00:07:35,890
It's unfair if you don't say, right?

1423
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,820
Okay, I'll make things clear, too.

1424
00:07:44,610 --> 00:07:46,570
Make what clear?

1425
00:07:46,570 --> 00:07:48,700
Don't worry about it. Come on.

1426
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:54,040
You've always been this way, Eita... 
Bein' a man of a few words.

1427
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:03,590
It went really far! Is that a home run?

1428
00:08:03,590 --> 00:08:04,840
That was a foul.

1429
00:08:11,470 --> 00:08:13,890
What, are you taking this seriously?

1430
00:08:15,930 --> 00:08:17,730
Oh, another foul.

1431
00:08:30,910 --> 00:08:33,410
Your pitch has gotten faster, hasn't it?

1432
00:08:49,470 --> 00:08:52,090
Another foul. What ball is he on?

1433
00:08:54,010 --> 00:08:55,260
And another.

1434
00:08:56,930 --> 00:08:58,730
Hazuki, where are you going?

1435
00:08:58,730 --> 00:09:00,100
Head back without me.

1436
00:09:04,650 --> 00:09:08,900
<i>I'd always listened to you trumpeting.</i>

1437
00:09:09,900 --> 00:09:14,030
<i>It was you! You were giving it your all, 
more so than the others.</i>

1438
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,160
Sorry!

1439
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:49,530
Hell yeah!

1440
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:53,810
Oh, crap. I'm supposed to respond 
to her message, if I hit a home run.

1441
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:05,210
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

1442
00:10:05,710 --> 00:10:07,090
Let's head back, Mio.

1443
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:10,710
I need to do my best, too.

1444
00:10:10,710 --> 00:10:12,220
Mio?

1445
00:10:15,850 --> 00:10:17,640
I already suck at playing.

