The seats are two-seaters, after all.

1455
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:37,200
It's just romantic.

1456
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:43,370
It's because he only pitches straight balls...

1457
00:10:43,370 --> 00:10:46,330
That reminds me, did you get 
permission to enter the photo?

1458
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:48,210
Not yet.

1459
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:50,670
Is that okay? The deadline's next week, you know.

1460
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:55,680
What do you think I should do to get permission?

1461
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:57,970
Uh...

1462
00:10:57,970 --> 00:11:00,260
If you can't push him, 
then all you can do is back off, right?

1463
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:01,720
That's it!

1464
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,320
Soma!

1465
00:11:23,250 --> 00:11:25,000
You need something?

1466
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,290
I've been wanting to tell you something for a while.

1467
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:30,000
I'm gonna go.

1468
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:32,000
No, stay! I'll be done in a minute.

1469
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,260
Well... Huh?

1470
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:37,260
Soma, hold out your hand.

1471
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:38,890
Hm? Like this?

1472
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,600
What's this?

1473
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,770
An eraser.

1474
00:11:42,770 --> 00:11:45,600
I know that. But what's this for?

1475
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:49,270
You lent me one in middle school, remember?

1476
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,270
Huh?

1477
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:53,780
I thought I'd give you another eraser. 
Or I guess I should say I always forgot about it.

1478
00:11:54,780 --> 00:11:56,900
Well, something came up.

1479
00:11:57,780 --> 00:11:59,030
Something?

1480
00:11:59,030 --> 00:12:01,660
Anyway, that's why I'm giving it to you.

1481
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:10,500
So, what happened?

1482
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:11,840
Nothing, really.

1483
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,420
What? Tell me!

1484
00:12:13,420 --> 00:12:14,590
Next time, okay? Next time.

1485
00:12:14,590 --> 00:12:16,630
Come on, you can tell me!

1486
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:18,180
So, what was that about?

1487
00:12:18,180 --> 00:12:19,890
Figure that out yourself.

1488
00:12:31,730 --> 00:12:33,690
Could it be that Natsume-san...

